    16	- ``LEGACY``   — stamp missing (records predate the mechanism) or holds a
    17	  known-past value: readable, but must not be pooled with current-version
    18	  records without an explicit same-data A/B note (§6.6 rule 1).
    19	- ``MISMATCH`` — stamp is not a recognized value (e.g. a future version
    20	  read by older code): refuse to pool.
